<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APL Ltd raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APL Ltd raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded APL Ltd to outperform from neutral because the shares are trading below book value.</p>
<p>-- despite the rating upgrade, Gruntal said it cut the 1997 earnings estimates to $2.25 a share from $2.50 a share and cut the 1998 estimate to $3.00 a share from $3.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- APL gained 1-3/4 to 21-3/4 in late morning trading.</p>
</text>
